{
  "SM_002100_0150_COL": "“Thank you!”",
  "BK_2000_0060_CER": "“Come on Cereza, get it together.\r\nI'm going...I'm going to be a witch!”",
  "LV_002905_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]There's power here. It feels big.[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire sensed something nearby.",
  "SM_002100_0040_NAR": "Just thinking about her next dream,\r\nCereza couldn't help but smile.",
  "SM_002140_0050_FAS": "“You know, I haven't introduced myself.\r\nMy name is Ignis, \r\nthe keeper of this forest.”",
  "SM_002060_0030_CER": "“Careful, Cheshire!\r\nI don't know if wisps can have\r\nheart attacks, but scares like\r\nthat can't be good either way.”",
  "LV_002035_0120_CER": "Oh, stop! Don't forget whose elemental \r\nmagic you use to transform like that!",
  "CE_002815_0000_CER": "Unnggh... ungghh... haa!",
  "SM_002140_0060_FAS": "“Good on you for taking \r\ncare of that circus.\r\nI knew I was right about you.”",
  "SM_002060_0000_COL": "“This is our secret base.\r\nUsually it's strictly wisps only,\r\nbut I'll make an exception.”",
  "BK_2000_0050_CER": "“I-I can fight! \r\nDon't treat me like a helpless child!”",
  "LV_002035_0015_NAR": "Cheshire said in a bitter tone.",
  "SM_002130_0135_CER": "“Okay...Tell me more.”",
  "LV_002900_0000_CER": "What is with that jester?\r\nHe's such a bother!",
  "SM_002010_0100_COL": "“I want to go help them,\r\nbut I don't stand a chance\r\nagainst those faeries!”",
  "SM_002010_0180_NAR": "Cheshire made it clear he wanted\r\nno part in this daring rescue.\r\n\r\nBut Cereza was determined.\r\n",
  "SM_002010_0010_NAR": "Cereza remembered something \r\nMorgana had told her long ago.\r\n\r\nChildren who perish in Avalon\r\nbecome wisps, their souls cursed\r\nto wander the forest forever...",
  "CE_002070_0000_CER": "Time for the finale!",
  "LV_002080_0020_NAR": "Cereza suddenly let out a yawn. She was exhausted.",
  "SM_002140_0100_NAR": "Knowing this voice belonged \r\nto a wisp put Cereza \r\ninfinitely more at ease.",
  "SM_002130_0150_FAS": "“The crazed ringmaster\r\nenslaves poor souls there to perform \r\nin his shows until they die.”",
  "SM_002040_0050_CER": "“Look how happy they are.\r\nColm and his friends can live\r\ntogether again.\r\nMaybe find some solace in\r\nthis forsaken forest...”",
  "SM_002140_0010_CER": "“That voice...”",
  "SM_002140_0210_FAS": "“Something the matter?”",
  "SM_002110_0090_CER": "“Do you have any idea how important\r\nhair is to a witch? Be careful!”",
  "_05": "",
  "SM_002130_0120_FAS": "“But you won't be able to find \r\nthose Elemental Cores \r\nas easy as you think.”",
  "LV_002930_0000_CER": "Right, you can't stand rosemary.\r\nFine, just stay where you are.",
  "SM_002140_0045_CER": "“So you're the one who \r\ntalked to us back there!”",
  "CE_002040_0000_CER": "Hey, the switches flipped over \r\nand now I can't press them!",
  "SM_002130_0080_FAS": "“Oh, but you're looking for \r\na white wolf, aren't you?”",
  "_01": "",
  "SM_002130_0110_FAS": "“Trust in the path you take now...\r\nIt's the right one.”",
  "SM_002040_0180_CER": "“If I had been stronger\r\nI could have saved her that night...”\r\n",
  "SM_002040_0100_NAR": "But as she said these words\r\nCereza realised something...",
  "IN_2000_0010_NAR": "Cereza teased the demon,\r\nwho responded with a cold glare.",
  "LV_002070_0010_NAR": "Cereza squealed in delight. She was still a child, after all.",
  "SM_002140_0180_FAS": "“No need to worry.\r\nJust drain the water!”",
  "_54": "",
  "LV_002005_0030_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Looks good. Quick, let's go get it![FONT:N ]",
  "SM_002100_0110_COL": "“Can I trouble you with \r\none last request?”",
  "SM_002080_0010_CER": "“Not bad, huh?\r\nTold you I'm good for more\r\nthan just carrying you around.”",
  "SM_002050_0000_COL": "“Thank you Cereza!”",
  "SM_002140_0220_CER": "“Nope, not a thing!\r\nClock towers...giant statues...\r\nYes, witches love high places!\r\nThanks for your help!”",
  "LV_002010_0010_CER": "One of those wisps\r\nis being bullied...But...\r\nI can't help them by myself...",
  "SM_002100_0120_COL": "“If you find any more of my\r\nfriends captured in the forest,\r\nwould you be so kind as to save\r\nthem and send them back here?”",
  "IN_2000_0020_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]I strike any pests who come near.[FONT:N ]",
  "CE_002080_0000_CER": "Unngghh!",
  "SM_002130_0160_CER": "“Until they...die?”",
  "SM_002080_0040_NAR": "Cereza was fed up with\r\nCheshire's arrogant attitude.",
  "LV_002035_0115_NAR": "Cheshire scowled at Cereza menacingly.",
  "LV_002040_0030_CER": "I wish I could've played \r\nwith Mummy at a place like this.",
  "BK_2000_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Get out of the way![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire yelled at the terrified Cereza.",
  "SM_002060_0090_COL": "“And for you, I have this.\r\nWe don't know how to use it,\r\nbut it seems to have some kind of magic.”",
  "CE_002800_0000_CER": "We're getting nowhere with him on that ball.\r\nLet's just pull it out from under him!",
  "SM_002060_0100_CER": "“Thank you!”",
  "IN_2000_0040_CER": "Is that so!",
  "SM_002130_0010_CER": "“W-who's there!?”",
  "CE_002000_0000_CER": "Get down from there!",
  "SM_002060_0130_COL": "“Don't mention it! Let me\r\nknow if you need anything else.”",
  "LV_002035_0020_CER": "You'd think your tongue was for complaining\r\nwith the fuss you're making.\r\nYou want to go home, don't you?",
  "SM_002130_0210_FAS": "“Well, I'm afraid I must go.\r\nI wish you both safe travels.”",
  "SM_002100_0050_CER": "“The white wolf!”",
  "LV_002055_0010_NAR": "Saving the wisps brought a small joy to Cereza's heart.",
  "LV_002905_0010_CER": "The Elemental Core is near!\r\nMaybe inside that tent...?",
  "LV_002090_0010_CER": "What is that?",
  "BK_2010_0040_LUC": "“Dry your tears...”",
  "SM_002010_0030_COL": "“Who are you? Are you lost?”",
  "SM_002040_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]What was the point of saving \r\nthese things again?[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire asked flatly.",
  "SM_002110_0070_CER": "“Cheshire!\r\nAhhh, now my hair's all sticky!”",
  "SM_002010_0000_CER": "“Could that be...a wisp?”",
  "SM_002130_0060_FAS": "“Try asking me something \r\nif you don't believe me.\r\nI'll answer any question you have.”",
  "SM_002140_0030_NAR": "Cereza looked in the voice's \r\ndirection to see a strange wisp, \r\nburied deep in a cap.",
  "SM_002040_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Who cares about them?[FONT:N ]\r\nreplied Cheshire.\r\nDemons are not known for\r\ntheir altruism.",
  "SM_002140_0120_CER": "“You said your name was Ignis, right?”",
  "SM_002010_0190_CER": "“Well I'm going, even if I have to\r\nfight those faeries myself!”",
  "LV_002915_0000_CER": "Wheeee!\r\nI wonder where this'll take me.",
  "LV_002050_0010_CER": "I've got to be careful.\r\nIf they spot me, I'll be in trouble.",
  "SM_002130_0180_FAS": "“But you needn't worry. \r\nYou and that demon of yours \r\nwon't croak that easily.”",
  "SM_002140_0150_CER": "“The bottom of the lake?!”",
  "SM_002040_0110_CER": "“Oh...I suppose...\r\nI tore you apart from those you love \r\nwhen I called you to this world...”",
  "SM_002040_0190_NAR": "As she spoke, visions of the night she\r\nfailed to save her mother flashed\r\nbefore Cereza's eyes.",
  "SM_002010_0160_NAR": "Girl and Demon squared off.\r\nNeither budged an inch.\r\n",
  "SM_002010_0070_CER": "“Colm, you look troubled.\r\nIs something the matter?”\r\n",
  "SM_002040_0080_CER": "“What are you saying?\r\nYou would just abandon them?”",
  "LV_002925_0000_CER": "Did we...switch places...?",
  "SM_002020_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Ya? How's a weakling like you\r\ngonna save anyone?[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon chuckled,\r\nhis mouth twisted in a cruel grin.",
  "SM_002020_0000_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_002140_0160_CER": "“Well, I suppose that's lucky.\r\nI was always better at sinking than swimming.”",
  "SM_002110_0080_NAR": "Cheshire enjoyed his snack\r\nas Cereza tried unsuccessfully\r\nto squeeze the pulp from her hair.",
  "SM_002010_0040_CER": "“Y-you can talk?!”",
  "SM_002060_0050_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]We have a job to do.\r\nNo time to play fort with \r\nthese pipsqueaks,[FONT:N ]\r\nsaid Cheshire, as he eyed Colm.\r\n",
  "LV_002005_0010_CER": "What could that be?",
  "SM_002050_0010_NAR": "Colm was chuffed.\r\nHe told them he wanted to show\r\nhis thanks for saving his friends.",
  "SM_002080_0000_NAR": "They had defeated the formidable faerie.\r\nIf only slightly, Cereza felt that\r\nshe had made a difference.",
  "BK_8100_0010_CER": "“I know, hold on.\r\nI wonder what power you'll\r\nget this time...”",
  "CE_002030_0000_CER": "What are those switches \r\nin front of each pillar?",
  "CE_002100_0000_CER": "Cheshire, help!",
  "SM_002130_0050_CER": "“...Says the creepy voice from the shadows.”",
  "SM_002140_0080_FAS": "“A pity.”",
  "IN_2000_0000_CER": "So after all that fuss, \r\nyou're going to help after all.",
  "SM_002010_0080_COL": "“My friends...\r\nThe faeries took them away.”",
  "SM_002130_0170_FAS": "“My apologies...Was that too scary?”",
  "SM_002010_0110_CER": "“You just leave those \r\nmean, old faeries to me!”",
  "LV_002095_0010_CER": "I saw this act at a fair once.\r\nNever thought I'd be the one performing...",
  "SM_002010_0044_CER": "“I'm Cereza. What's your name?”",
  "SM_002140_0230_FAS": "“You're very welcome.”",
  "SM_002020_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Something happens to you,\r\nand it's my neck too.[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon was just looking\r\nout for himself after all.",
  "SM_002120_0000_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Can't you move any faster?[FONT:N ]\r\nThe wolf was getting away,\r\nand Cheshire was not happy about it.",
  "LV_002030_0020_CER": "Maybe we can use it to go to places we couldn't before!",
  "CE_002805_0000_CER": "Every shot, he dodges!\r\nThere must be some way to hit him...",
  "LV_002030_0010_CER": "This new power...",
  "SM_002010_0120_COL": "“What...for true!?”",
  "SM_002040_0150_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I'm this strong as a newborn!\r\nJust imagine when I grow![FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon interrupted Cereza's\r\nintrospection with rapturous laughter.",
  "SM_002140_0110_NAR": "But Cheshire said not a word.\r\nHe seemed to have \r\nno interest in the wisp at all.",
  "LV_002080_0030_NAR": "She decided to rest here for a bit.",
  "SM_002130_0140_FAS": "“Ahead, there is an old circus \r\ntent faeries use to lure human \r\nchildren into the forest.”",
  "SM_002130_0090_CER": "“H-how did you know...?”",
  "LV_002910_0000_CER": "That noise!\r\nIt's coming this way!",
  "SM_002100_0140_CER": "“You have my word!”",
  "SM_002100_0060_NAR": "At the sight of the wolf,\r\nCereza jumped to her feet.",
  "LV_002055_0020_CER": "Those faeries are just awful.\r\nDon't fear, wisps! I'll save you!",
  "CE_002060_0000_CER": "Oh, so they work like the switches.",
  "SM_002100_0170_COL": "“Take care Cereza, take care kitty!”",
  "LV_002090_0020_NAR": "In the distance stood a massive tent dyed the colour of fresh blood.\r\nIt seemed to taunt Cereza, drawing her towards it.",
  "SM_002140_0070_FAS": "“Something tells me \r\nthat ringmaster won't be \r\nenjoying his trapeze any more.”",
  "SM_002060_0010_COL": "“Hey, where'd your kitty friend go?”",
  "SM_002130_0020_NAR": "Cereza's heart leapt at the sudden voice.",
  "SM_002130_0130_CER": "“You know about the Elemental Cores too!?”",
  "LV_002035_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]My tongue is for lickin' prey.\r\nHow long are you gonna make me do this?[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_002100_0100_CER": "“Sorry, we're in a hurry.”",
  "LV_002005_0020_NAR": "Cereza spotted something that looked like fruit.",
  "SM_002140_0200_CER": "“The tallest tree, huh...”",
  "SM_002080_0030_CER": "“Hmph, you stuck-up demon!”",
  "SM_002100_0090_COL": "“Awww, you're leaving already?”\r\n",
  "SM_002100_0010_NAR": "The boy's final words were\r\nstill ringing in her ears.",
  "SM_002050_0020_COL": "“Follow me!”",
  "SM_002140_0190_FAS": "“But you'll have to go over \r\na towering tree in order to \r\nget there. To get to the bottom \r\nof a lake, you need to climb \r\nthe tallest tree in the forest. \r\nIsn't that poetic?”",
  "LV_002920_0000_CER": "It's coming this way!\r\nWhat is that thing!?",
  "LV_002065_0010_CER": "You walk fast for someone \r\nwith such short legs, Colm.",
  "SM_002140_0000_FAS": "“Have fun at the circus?”",
  "SM_002030_0010_NAR": "Cereza teased the demon,\r\nwho responded with a cold glare.",
  "SM_002060_0060_COL": "“Why, someone's a grumpy cat!\r\nI have something for you too!”",
  "CE_002050_0000_CER": "What do these levers do..?",
  "SM_002060_0140_NAR": "With that, Colm ran off\r\nto frolic with his ethereal chums.",
  "SM_002030_0020_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]I strike any pests who come near.\r\nUnlike you, I have the strength\r\nto protect myself,[FONT:N ]\r\nchided the demon.\r\n",
  "IN_2000_0030_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Unlike you, I have the strength\r\nto protect myself, [FONT:N ]chided the demon.\r\n",
  "SM_002100_0130_COL": "“We'll make it worth your while,\r\nI promise!”",
  "SM_002100_0020_NAR": "Cereza's chest felt warm.\r\nAs if in this dark, cold forest,\r\na flame had been lit \r\ndeep in her heart.",
  "SM_002130_0220_NAR": "The voice faded away\r\nand silence once again enveloped the forest.",
  "SM_002120_0040_NAR": "The demon said nothing.\r\nHis glare was all the answer Cereza needed.",
  "_71": "",
  "SM_002040_0120_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I was just born.\r\nThere's nobody I love.\r\nNo need for love. Only strength.[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon's philosophy was simple.",
  "SM_002110_0110_CER": "“Q-quiet!\r\nI'm working on it, just you wait!”",
  "SM_002010_0150_CER": "“Well we can't just abandon them!”",
  "BK_2010_0020_CER": "“M-Mummy? \r\nWhere are you Mummy?”",
  "CE_002035_0000_CER": "Pressing it moves the spotlight \r\nto the top of the pillar...",
  "SM_002130_0100_FAS": "“You are a part of this forest now.\r\nThat means your business \r\nhas become my business.”",
  "BK_2010_0010_CER": "“Why...why won't it open?”",
  "SM_002040_0000_CER": "“Thank goodness you're all safe.\r\nThat was a bit closer than I expected.”",
  "SM_002140_0040_CER": "“A wisp?”",
  "CE_002090_0000_CER": "Can't...move...",
  "SM_002020_0030_NAR": "Cereza was secretly happy to see Cheshire,\r\nbut he was silently brooding.",
  "SM_002010_0020_CER": "“Hi there little guy...are you okay?”",
  "SM_002140_0090_CER": "“He was an absolute brute!\r\nPlay a bit part in someone else's show?\r\nNo thanks!”",
  "SM_002130_0040_FAS": "“Well, I'm not a faerie at least.\r\nTake my word on that one.”",
  "LV_002025_0010_CER": "We can't just abandon them!",
  "CE_002810_0000_CER": "I'm tired of your tricks!\r\nCheshire!",
  "SM_002120_0020_CER": "We'd be able to move a lot\r\nfaster if you would give me\r\na ride on your back!",
  "SM_002020_0060_CER": "“Well, with or without you,\r\nI'm still going to help those wisps.\r\nYou just sit back and watch!”\r\n",
  "SM_002130_0240_CER": "“Just who was that...?”",
  "CE_002010_0000_CER": "Here's our chance!",
  "SM_002120_0010_CER": "I'm going as fast as I can!",
  "SM_002020_0050_CER": "“Hmph.”",
  "LV_002080_0010_CER": "",
  "SM_002140_0130_CER": "“Ignis, you wouldn't happen to know \r\nwhere we can find the remaining\r\nElemental Cores...would you?”",
  "SM_002040_0170_CER": "“I-I'm going to be strong too!\r\nBut I'm going to do it with style,\r\nunlike some creatures I could name!”",
  "LV_002045_0010_NAR": "Can't get inside unless we lower that drawbridge.",
  "SM_002140_0020_NAR": "A familiar voice once again \r\nechoed through the trees.",
  "SM_002010_0090_NAR": "Colm's lower lip quivered\r\nas he spoke.\r\n\r\nHe explained how the faeries\r\nwould round up wisps and tease\r\nthem for sport.",
  "SM_002060_0110_COL": "“Cereza, you look tired.\r\nWe're safe here, so why don't \r\nyou take a little rest?”",
  "SM_002060_0080_CER": "“I think this is the happiest\r\nhe's been in a while, thanks.”",
  "LV_002035_0110_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]Hmph, you just can't do anything without me![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_2010_0060_LUC": "“A mother's warm embrace...\r\nYou will feel it again. As will I...”",
  "LV_002085_0020_NAR": "She enjoyed playing with the wisps, \r\nbut her journey was far from over.",
  "LV_002040_0020_CER": "Could...humans have been here?",
  "SM_002100_0160_NAR": "Saying farewell to Colm,\r\nthey resumed their chase.\r\nThe white wolf was just ahead!",
  "SM_002100_0070_CER": "“Cheshire, you're all fuelled up, \r\nright?”",
  "LV_002040_0010_CER": "What is this place...?\r\nSome kind of faerie playground?",
  "BK_2010_0050_LUC": "“You are stronger than you know...\r\nYour desire to save others\r\nwill give you strength...” ",
  "LV_002085_0010_NAR": "Cereza set off further into the forest.",
  "SM_002130_0200_FAS": "“That just proves they're scared of you.\r\nAnd that demon, of course...”",
  "CE_002000_0010_CER": "Cheshire can't reach that high.\r\nNo fair!",
  "SM_002060_0120_CER": "“Now that you mention it...\r\nI have been on edge ever since\r\ncoming to this forest.\r\n\r\nThanks for everything, Colm.”",
  "SM_002140_0140_FAS": "“Of course.\r\nThe next core is at \r\nthe bottom of the lake.”",
  "SM_002100_0030_CER": "I wonder when I'll see him again...\r\n",
  "SM_002060_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I couldn't care less about\r\nweaklings like him. [FONT:N ]",
  "SM_002130_0070_CER": "“Okay...Umm...\r\nHave you seen any wh-black wolves...\r\naround the forest lately?”",
  "SM_002030_0030_CER": "“Is that so!”",
  "LV_002065_0110_CER": "To be honest, until meeting you I\r\nthought wisps were just a tall tale.",
  "SM_002030_0000_CER": "“So after all that fuss, \r\nyou're going to help after all.”",
  "SM_002060_0070_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]You think a demon's hunger\r\nis so easily satiated?[FONT:N ]\r\nBut the drool dripping from the\r\ndemon's maw betrayed his cool exterior.",
  "LV_002935_0000_CER": "See that?\r\nTold you I'd save them myself.",
  "SM_002080_0020_NAR": "But Cheshire was not impressed.",
  "SM_002100_0000_CER": "“As will I...”",
  "BK_8100_0000_CER": "“It's just like before...”",
  "BK_2000_0020_NAR": "A massive faerie took them by surprise.\r\nOnce again, Cereza was petrified \r\nwith fear.",
  "SM_002020_0020_CER": "“I knew you'd come.\r\nYou need my magic energy, after all.\r\nSince you're here, how about \r\nlending me a paw?”",
  "SM_002040_0090_CER": "“Don't you know what it feels like\r\nto be torn from someone you love?”",
  "SM_002130_0000_FAS": "“Hello there, miss.”",
  "SM_002040_0010_NAR": "Cereza tried to put on a tough face,\r\nbut she was ashamed to have\r\nbeen saved by the demon yet again.",
  "SM_002010_0060_COL": "“I'm Colm!”",
  "SM_002130_0190_FAS": "“You've caused a big ruckus \r\namong those faeries \r\nsince you entered this forest.”",
  "LV_002015_0010_CER": "Cheshire, there's a wisp in trouble.\r\nLet's go help them!",
  "SM_002040_0020_NAR": "Cheshire had expected as much.\r\nHe sat and watched the wisps\r\nwith an uninterested expression.",
  "SM_002130_0030_FAS": "“Good question. Let's just say...\r\nI'm the one you talk to when you want \r\nto know about the goings-on in this forest.”",
  "SM_002010_0140_NAR": "The wisp wasn't the only one \r\nsurprised by Cereza's bold claim.",
  "CE_002020_0000_CER": "You're not going anywhere!",
  "SM_002110_0100_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Ya? All that fur on your head and a\r\nfat lot of good it's done you.[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon's retort was surprisingly deft.",
  "SM_002140_0170_CER": "“...The problem is coming back up again.”",
  "SM_002040_0130_CER": "“You were just born?\r\nThen you...”",
  "SM_002020_0090_NAR": "Pretending not to hear,\r\nCereza pressed ahead.",
  "SM_002120_0050_CER": "That's what I thought.",
  "SM_002130_0230_CER": "“And...she's gone.”"
}
